	(text "Bridge (D1-D4) full-wave rectifies J1; C1 is the reservoir cap.\nC2/C3 are the regulator input/output caps from the 78xx datasheet.\nD5 is a power-on indicator. Heatsink U1 above ~200 mA.\nAC1/AC2 use net labels in the drawing; on the board, J1 sits inside the\ndiode ring so both AC traces reach the bridge without crossing." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 60.96 127 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d2300bf3-37b3-5f8f-88aa-1f86c0be8b1a"))
